; The windtrap reporting binary — the third and last home of coverage
; code, and the same for mutation. Two subcommands, `coverage` and
; `mutate`: find and merge the .coverage files under _build/_coverage or
; the .mutants verdict files under _build/_mutants, and render. Both
; layouts live in the library renderer (reached through Windtrap.Private),
; so the in-process WINDTRAP_COVERAGE and WINDTRAP_MUTATE modes and these
; commands cannot drift. Neither command runs a test or drives a build.

(executable
 (name main)
 (public_name windtrap)
 (package windtrap)
 (libraries windtrap windtrap_coverage windtrap_instr windtrap_mutate))
